OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police swoop as man, 61,
OL,4,Aarrested for murder and woman in car
OL,5,Acrash dies
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 61-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of murder after a woman who
OL,9,Fcrashed her car died.
OL,11,FSouth Wales Police said the woman, 47,
OL,12,Ffrom North Cornelly, Bridgend, crashed
OL,13,Finto a wall on Coity Road at about
OL,14,F12:43 BST on Monday.
OL,16,FBut the force said she had suffered
OL,17,Finjuries "unrelated" to the crash.
OL,19,FIt followed armed police swooping on a
OL,20,Fnearby sheltered housing retirement
OL,21,Fcomplex, Ger-y-Nant, where the man was
OL,22,Farrested.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
